function wbFind(id){const o=wbList();for(const c of ["bg","person","relation"]){const e=o[c].find(x=>x.id===id);if(e)return {o,c,e}}return null}
ACT["wb-cat"]=el=>{S.misc.wbCat=el.dataset.v;save("misc");render()};
function wbSheet(entry){
 const isNew=!entry;
 openSheet('<div class="mtitle"><span class="mtt">'+(isNew?"新增条目":"编辑条目")+'</span><button class="ibtn" data-r="x">'+ico("close")+'</button></div>'+
  '<div class="row sliderrow" style="border:none"><span class="lab">条目标题</span><input id="wwt" value="'+esc(entry?entry.title||"":"")+'" placeholder="例如：人物：沈星回"></div>'+
  '<div class="row sliderrow" style="border:none"><span class="lab">条目内容</span><textarea id="wwc" style="min-height:130px" placeholder="写入具体设定…">'+esc(entry?entry.content||"":"")+"</textarea></div>"+
  '<div class="btnrow" style="justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:12px"><button class="btn" data-r="x">取消</button><button class="btn pri" data-r="ok">确定</button></div>',true);
 $("#modal .sheet").onclick=e=>{const b=e.target.closest("[data-r]");if(!b)return;
  const t=(($("#wwt")||{}).value||"").trim();const c=($("#wwc")||{}).value||"";
  closeModal();if(b.dataset.r!=="ok")return;if(!t&&!c.trim())return toast("请输入内容");
  if(isNew)wbList()[S.misc.wbCat||"bg"].push({id:uid(),title:t,content:c,on:true});
  else{entry.title=t;entry.content=c}
  wbSave();render();toast(isNew?"已新增条目":"已保存")};
}
ACT["wb-add"]=()=>wbSheet(null);
